{\sect \sectd }\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb240\sa80\li0\sl320{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Part 2 \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb240\sa0\keepn\li0\sl320{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Paragraphs 1 to 7}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0  of the Protocol to the Agreement \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb0\sa0\keepn\fi0\li0\sl320{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 between the Government of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region of the People\u8217??s Republic of \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb0\sa0\keepn\fi0\li0\sl320{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 China and the Government of the Republic of Korea \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb0\sa0\keepn\fi0\li0\sl320{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 for the Avoidance of Double Taxation and the \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb0\sa80\keepn\fi0\li0\sl320{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Prevention of Fiscal Evasion with respect to Taxes on Income\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 General\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 It is understood that the two Contracting Parties shall consult together at regular intervals regarding the terms, operation and application of the Agreement to ensure that it continues to serve the purposes of avoiding double taxation and preventing fiscal evasion and shall, where they consider it appropriate, conclude Protocols to amend the Agreement. The first such consultation shall take place no later than December 31}{\b0\i0\super\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 st }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 in the fifth year following the date on which the Agreement enters into force in accordance with the provisions of Article 27 (Entry into force). Further consultations shall take place thereafter at intervals of no more than five years. Notwithstanding, either Contracting Party may at any time request consultations with the other Contracting Party on matters relating to the terms, operation and application of the Agreement which it considers require urgent resolution. \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 With reference to Article 3\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 With reference to subparagraph (d) of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  of Article 3 of the Agreement, it is understood that the term \u8220??tax\u8221?? shall not include any amount which represents a penalty or interest imposed under the laws of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region or Korea relating to the taxes to which the Agreement applies. \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 With reference to Articles 8 and 27\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The operation of aircraft in international traffic carried on by an airline of one Contracting Party shall be exempt from value added tax and any similar tax imposed by the other Contracting Party on a reciprocal basis in accordance with the laws and regulations of the latter Contracting Party. \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 It is understood that the Agreement, upon conclusion between the two Contracting Parties, shall replace Article 9 of the Agreement between the Government of Hong Kong and the Government of the Republic of Korea concerning Air Services signed at Seoul on 29 March 1996 (hereinafter referred to as \u8220??the Air Services Agreement\u8221??). However, the provisions of the said Article 9 of the Air Services Agreement shall continue to have effect for the taxable years or years of assessment which are expired before the time at which the provisions of the Agreement shall be effective. \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 With reference to Article 18\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 With reference to }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  of Article 18 of the Agreement, it is understood that the provisions concerning government service cover the remuneration paid to an individual in respect of services rendered to the Bank of Korea, the Korea Export-Import Bank and other institutions performing functions of a governmental nature as may be specified and agreed upon in letters exchanged between the competent authorities of the Contracting Parties. \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 With reference to Article 24\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 6.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 It is understood that, subject to the provisions of Article 24 of the Agreement, the competent authorities of the Contracting Parties shall disclose any information that precedes the date on which the Agreement has effect for the tax for which information is sought, insofar as the information is foreseeably relevant for a taxable period or taxable event following that date. \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 7.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 It is understood that the provisions in Article 24 of the Agreement also cover any other taxes as may be specified and agreed upon in letters exchanged between the competent authorities of the Contracting Parties.\par }}
